flowchart TD
  setup([setup]):::gray
  plan[plan]:::teal
  impl[implement]:::teal
  unit[unit-test]:::teal
  verify[self-verify]:::teal
  pr[create-pr]:::purple
  monitor[monitor-pr]:::purple
  learn[learn]:::purple
  cleanup([cleanup]):::gray
  fix[fix-tests]:::amber
  blocked[notify-blocked]:::coral

  setup --> plan --> impl --> unit --> verify --> pr
  pr --> monitor & learn
  monitor & learn --> cleanup
  impl -->|exit 2| blocked
  impl -->|exit 3| fix
  unit -->|fail| fix
  verify -->|fail| fix
  fix -->|retry| unit
  blocked --> cleanup

  classDef teal   fill:#1D9E75,stroke:#085041,color:#ffffff
  classDef purple fill:#534AB7,stroke:#26215C,color:#ffffff
  classDef gray   fill:#888780,stroke:#2C2C2A,color:#ffffff
  classDef amber  fill:#BA7517,stroke:#412402,color:#ffffff
  classDef coral  fill:#993C1D,stroke:#4A1B0C,color:#ffffff
